🚀 Let's weave success stories together 🌐  Greetings! I'm Oleksandr, a dynamic Business Development Manager at Drum'N'Code, where I orchestrate collaborations that harmonize business prowess delivering excellence and in Web and Mobile solutions development.  💡 Innovate, Collaborate, Elevate: If you're a fellow advocate of growth, a seeker of innovation, and an enthusiast for partnerships that transcend boundaries, then our trajectories are aligned. Together, we can weave success stories.  ✨ Fueling Transformative Partnerships: At Drum'N'Code, I channel my passion for partnerships and innovation into fostering symbiotic alliances that drive both business expansion and technological advancement.   If you're excited, I'm eager to collaborate and connect.  #InnovationMatters #TechEntrepreneurship #ProjectsCollaboration Zaporizhzhya, Zaporizhzhya, Ukraine Drum'N'Code Head of Sales and Business Development 'createdAt': '2024-03-22T05:45:57.922Z', 'updatedAt': '2024-03-28T13:11:23.531Z', 'actualAt': '2024-03-22T05:45:57.922Z', 'sentAtToPAS': '2024-03-28T13:11:23.512Z', 'id': 15281, 'personId': 22907, 'title': 'Head of Sales and Business Development', 'companyName': "Drum'N'Code", 'companyId': '12575951', 'dateRange': 'start': 'year': 2023, 'month': 7, 'end': None, 'locationName': 'Zaporizhzhya, Ukraine · On-site', 'description': "- Cultivate long-lasting connections with both existing and prospective clients;
- Uncover emerging markets and changing customer requirements;
- Harmonize company offerings with the current and future goals of clients;
- Evaluate the organization's strengths in response to customer demands;
