Many medical firms collect only 60-70% or less on their insurance billing. There is no reason to accept a 30%+ loss of income. My stellar team and I identify and resolve the reasons clients are not getting paid what they are owed. We prepare a no-cost sample analysis report that shows why frankly, their current billing staff or outside billing company has dropped the ball and how some of the lost income may be recovered. We not only collect on old claims but the information we share tremendously helps our clients in reducing denials in the future.

mr2 employs a system developed to a high degree of complexity to analyze the insurance A/R, investing significant time and resources, to show our clients exactly where their current biller or billing company is missing the mark. Within 48 hours they receive detailed information regarding not only why claims are denied, but more importantly what needs to be done to correct the issues.

