      allowed me the knowledge of fermentation processes in pilot and laboratory systems. It was possible 
      apply the technique of magnetic resonance to different biological samples in different redox states.', 'isDefault': False, 'url': None, 'organizationDescription': None, 'website': None, 'domain': None Hospital & Health Care Odivelas, Lisbon, Portugal - Degree in Biochemistry, in Faculdade de Ciências Universidade de Lisboa, Lisbon (Portugal), Final Thesis: In recent decades, one of the most important anthropogenic factors that contribute to shifting the balance of ecosystems is the widespread introduction into the environment of industrial xenobiotic compounds. The profound change in ecosystems, for which man depends, is leading to serious consequences which are reflected in a more visible increase in allergic disease or environmental carcinogenesis. - Specialist in Clinical Analyzes, Order of Biologists. - Pos-Graduated 6 Sigma Black Belt Level, in Instituto Politécnico de Leiria (Management College), Leiria (Portugal)  Actually as Higher Technical Coordinator/ Responsible of Executive Officer of Quality (Technical Department) is responsible for: Laboratory Organization, Quality, Management and Training of Clinical technicians. Coordinator of the Implementation of DMAIC methodology, development of Six Sigma philosophy in the area of Healthcare. Coordinator of LEAN Six Sigma projects.  Implementation of the ISO9001 Quality System, and management, organization and control of pre-analytical, analytical and post-analytical processes. Responsible for the development of the concept of control of median and average of analytical parameter patient results, as a measure of pre-analytical and analytical stability. Responsible for validation of laboratory methods (Selection, design/adaptation, and execution of new methodologies in the experimental phase). Responsible for the characterization, development and statistical treatment of data in clinical research projects and scientific publications (biosciences).  Trainee tutor of Technical and University schools internships.  Centro Medicina Laboratorial Dr. Germano de Sousa Technical Coordination Director / Bioch / Lean Six Sigma Black Belt

